WEBVTT

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:03.220
What the hell?

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:07.740
I was just about to head to a 
sweets buffet with my FayFre—

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:07.730
<b>* FayFre = Fairy Friend</b>

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:09.310
Hey.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.590
K-Kokoro-chan?

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:16.980
What's wrong with you?

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.310
Did you finally acquire a vibrate function?

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:22.360
Y-You... You... You!

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:23.860
You!

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.460
Stick your faces on the 
ground right this instant!

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.310
Seriously, what's going on?!

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:31.400
Don't you know?!

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.210
This man is...

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:36.470
He's the next King of the Fairies!

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:39.480
King of the Fairies?

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:41.530
Hi!

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:17.240
My card. A pleasure.

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:20.980
Yes, sir! It's a very great 
pleasure to meet you, sir!

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:25.750
That mystery fairy tradition, the business 
card exchange, has begun...

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.500
D-Does that mean... um...

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:31.250
You want to see my chibi form?

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:32.580
Here!

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:35.500
No thanks, no thanks, no thanks!

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:37.250
<i>He's the real thing...</i>

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:42.730
I originally came out here 
for an extended vacation.

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:45.090
But when things turned out the way they did,

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:48.190
I ended up running a little 
investigation of my own.

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:52.510
<i>I wonder if they just come and go like 
they're vacationing in Hawaii...</i>

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:56.460
Kokoro-chan, you went all this 
time without noticing him?

00:02:56.460 --> 00:03:00.000
Don't you have sensors to detect others of 
your kind, or telepathy, or something?

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:02.780
Gimme a break! Do you people 
memorize the daily schedules

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:05.310
of all the members of <i>you</i>r royal families?!

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.450
Don't underestimate the vertical 
strata of fairy society!

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:10.590
S-Sorry! Don't get so upset!

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:13.750
You start in primary, go through 
secondary and tertiary...

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.710
Well, it's not just fairies.

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:17.080
All powerful magical beings have the 
ability to conceal their nature.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.520
That goes double if you're 
of especially high rank.

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:21.610
So don't be too hard on him.

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:24.140
I was the one who chose to hide it.

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:27.180
Hyoe-sama! May I please lick your boots?

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:28.340
Please don't.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:33.810
Is it okay for someone of your rank 
to be revealing himself to us?

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:39.840
Oh? I don't believe I've said
 a word about who I am.

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:44.090
You're just spinning your own 
little fantasy. I'm fine.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:46.900
This guy... he's so shameless.

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:48.070
Speaking of which,

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:52.900
you've really been going all out 
with your magical girl idol thing.

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:54.940
Uh oh, you're in trouble.

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:56.910
Our manager's the one who...

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:03.090
A pleasure to meet you!

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:06.840
I'm Yamo, and I'll be your 
manager starting today!

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:10.470
My favorite magical girl is Creamy Mami!

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:12.470
Look at this, you two!

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:20.480
Lalayu Pro, Inc
Nanbu Department Store
Rooftop Concert Participation Project

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:14.310
I got you a job!

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:16.760
And it's for singing and dancing!

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:20.470
Of course, you'll have to wear animal 
suits on a department store roof...

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:27.850
Saki-chan, you dance like 
a bug. In a good way!

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:33.280
Is Konami-san really...

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:37.090
Is our manager really 
the one behind all this?

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:39.870
I know you don't want to believe it.

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:45.030
And while he's been acting suspiciously,
 that's all there's ever been to it.

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:48.600
I don't know what he wants 
or why he wants it.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:49.760
Then...

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:52.740
But I'm afraid to tell you, I do have proof.

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:54.590
Here.

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:00.730
I-Is this... a composite image?

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:01.370
Photoshop?

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:05.570
It's not a composite, a Photoshop, 
or a sticker slapped on the frame.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:10.020
Um... are you friends with Fujimoto-san?

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:11.680
Huh? That's your first question?

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:13.190
You must really be flustered...

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:15.570
This time around, we just 
happen have a common goal,

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:17.370
so we're collaborating, you could say.

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:20.130
After all, fairies are quite weak.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:23.080
If I got into a fight, I'd be 
killed with one strike.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:26.370
But he can handle things, I think.

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:27.380
Right?

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:28.390
Y-Yes, sir!

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:31.860
<i>Fujimoto-san is such an enigma...</i>

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:33.690
Ah, so that call before...

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:35.390
...was to report this?

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.470
Yes, I told him to call 
if something happened...

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.110
Hello?

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:45.180
Saki. Hey, Saki.

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:46.330
What is it?

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:48.320
My brother is gone.

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:52.240
But he was playing with the 
birds just a minute ago!

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:55.790
You sure he's not just eating 
some karinto off the road?

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:59.030
Not even my brother would 
eat things off the ground... probably.

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:02.070
Mohiro-chan! Mohiro—

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:03.030
Saki, there!

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:05.220
Look! Over there!

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:06.200
When the heck...

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:10.460
He probably took Mohiro through there.

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:11.230
No way!

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:12.770
And it's not just that.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:17.980
Right now, there are gates opening up 
all over town, and demons are everywhere.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:19.690
<b>Two</b>

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:19.690
<b>Three</b>

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:20.690
<b>Four</b>

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:20.690
Fujimoto

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:21.940
<b>Five</b>

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:22.440
<b>Six</b>

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:27.680
It seems that manager of yours 
is about to get serious.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:33.450
<b>Magical Girl - Final Battle</b>

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:41.210
Wh-What is this?

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:58.600
<b>We have reduced animation quality so we can get on
with the story. We appreciate your understanding.</b>

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:42.840
Saki, your face!

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:49.160
What is all this? What's going on?

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:51.490
The world is literally falling apart.

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:54.440
Is our manager really behind all this?

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:59.520
I wonder if the world's been falling 
apart in subtle ways this whole time...

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:00.530
Like there,

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:01.510
and there,

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:02.980
and that time, too...

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:05.480
No, I don't think that's what that was.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:07.840
Anyway, we have to do something!

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:10.720
But what can we do? 
There's too many of them!

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:14.990
<b>Villain Broadcast</b>

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:18.990
<i>The demons have hijacked 
all your TV transmissions!</i>

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:21.990
That masked stranger... can that be him?

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:24.180
W-What's he doing?

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:33.720
<b>Villain Broadcast</b>

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:28.810
<i>Ahem. Attention, humans cowering in fear.</i>

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:31.920
<i>Your weapons are useless against us!</i>

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.710
<i>And on top of that, I have in my clutches...</i>

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:38.720
<b>Villain Broadcast</b>

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:38.720
<b>Now in season</b>

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:38.720
<b>Fresh Mohiro-kun (slightly bruised) at a special price!</b>

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:38.720
Phone lines are currently busy

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:36.360
<i>...Mikage Mohiro of Star Prince!</i>

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:38.740
<i>That's right, I have a hostage!</i>

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:43.110
<i>Humanity's one and only 
hope... Magical Girls!</i>

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:45.730
<i>What will you do now?</i>

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:50.640
<i>If you want to restore the peace, 
come through my gate and defeat me!</i>

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:52.390
<i>If you don't hurry,</i>

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:55.740
<i>I can't guarantee the safety of 
the hostage... or the world!</i>

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.790
It's clearly a trap.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:03.530
He's trying to lead you into his home base.

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:08.260
It would be unbelievably reckless to enter 
the enemy territory without a plan.

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:11.690
I... I...

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:13.780
I'll go!

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:15.730
Please, let me go!

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:17.140
Me, too.

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:24.850
You mean it?

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:26.640
Kokoro-chan, please.

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:28.260
Sure.

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:40.480
I'll start searching for a way 
to seal the gates, then.

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:44.510
Fairy magic and demon magic have 
similar properties, after all.

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:47.640
You two... take care of Mohiro.

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:49.140
Okay!

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:03.280
Okay! We're off!

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:05.130
Hyoe-san, take care!

00:09:05.130 --> 00:09:06.010
Okay.

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:11.770
What's going on?!

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.690
That's so funny! Let's 
take a picture, Michiru!

00:09:14.690 --> 00:09:15.920
Don't be ridiculous!

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:18.770
I can't show this face to the world!

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:24.790
#DailyMichiru #Somehow #Ugly #CutestInTheGalaxy
 #CafeDate #Coffee #MichiruGotCocoa #CutestInTheUniverse
 #UsingAllMyPhoneFunctions #TotallySweet

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:28.550
Awesome! It's gone viral!

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:31.600
People are really posting everywhere!

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:34.070
Hey, does this seem kind of bad to you?

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:39.300
This place...

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.690
This is the demon world?

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.690
It's surprisingly whimsical and weird.

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:46.680
There are cameras here, too.

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:49.300
Is he trying to put on a show?

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.950
Manager... what in the 
world are you thinking?

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:59.150
What an ostentatious door!

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:59.160
<b>Final Boss Chamber Here</b>

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:02.270
Seriously, what is our manager thinking?

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:04.170
He's serving up RPG-level user-friendliness...

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:05.590
<i>Game saved.</i>

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:07.280
<i>Game saved.</i>

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:10.000
He's mocking us, dammit!

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:11.800
Hey, it doesn't open...

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:13.910
Yeah, this might be a trap.

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:16.640
I thought it felt strangely quiet.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:19.050
They were waiting for us.

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:22.970
An all-star showing of earlier monsters?

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:25.750
No, I'm seeing a lot of new faces.

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:30.010
It looks like a lot of midboss-tier ones...

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:37.600
We don't have any time to waste on this!

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:36.490
<b>Final Boss Chamber Here</b>

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.800
Hang on just a minute.

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:52.000
S-Sakuyo, what...

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:55.680
Leave this to me and go on ahead.

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:57.650
No! You can't!

00:10:57.650 --> 00:11:00.000
You can't fight all those enemies...

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:05.080
And... won't you lose your 
power if I'm not with you?

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:08.020
Don't worry. I have a plan.

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:08.860
But...

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:09.700
Saki!

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:13.710
Who was it you become a magical girl for?

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:16.510
To protect my brother, wasn't it?

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:26.010
Go, already.

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:31.370
Give our manager a few hundred slaps 
in the face and set him straight.

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:33.200
Sakuyo...

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:38.850
I'm all right.

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:43.850
I have my handmade Saki doll.

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:46.050
I love Sakuyo!

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:48.860
And in your right hand, 
there's a doll of me!

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:51.330
When did you...

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.290
I love Saki!

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:58.970
No matter how far apart we are, 
we'll always be together.

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:01.620
We always have been, and we always will be.

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:04.870
Don't worry.

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:10.110
I won't fall until I can live 
a happy, kissy life with you.

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:17.660
Besides... do you remember who it 
was I became a magical girl for?

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:23.810
I want to fight for the person 
I love... to protect them.

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:28.330
Sakuyo...

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:35.360
Sakuyo... I love you so much!

00:12:35.930 --> 00:12:39.500
Even if you're just saying that 
to me as a best friend...

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.490
Even so...

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:47.000
being a maiden in love means 
being willing to die for that!

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:50.980
Pictures of Saki that I've 
collected... thousands of them!

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:54.250
They're more important to me than my life...

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:57.580
But Saki is even more important to me!

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:59.680
And for her sake, I will 
throw them all away!

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:04.840
Now, go ahead. Cross over 
those pictures and attack me.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:08.130
However... when you do...

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:10.260
I will become stronger!

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:26.040
I'm impressed that you made 
it this far, Magical Girl.

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:31.720
Coming all this way for humankind... 
I admire your courage.

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:33.540
However...

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:36.040
I have a hostage!

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:38.040
And there's one other thing...

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:42.460
Shall I tell you what it is, you great fool?

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:47.900
Yes, the true boss of the demons is I!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:53.970
<b>Dun-dun-dunnn</b>

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:53.970
How will they fight him?!
Find out after the commercials!!!!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:53.970
<b>The truth will be revealed...</b>

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:53.970
Manager of Magical Girls, Yamo Konami!

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:08.990
<b>Dun-dun-dunnn</b>

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:08.990
<b>Now, the truth is revealed...</b>

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:08.990
Manager of Magical Girls, Yamo Konami!

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:13.510
Cut!

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:14.500
Okay, all done.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.530
Let's take five!

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:18.460
'Kay!

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:20.880
Saki-chan, great work!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.250
I bet that was a huge shock!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:24.170
Learning that I'm the big boss...

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:27.160
Sorry for dragging you all the way
 out to the demon world, too!

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:29.150
Huh? Where's Sakuyo-chan?

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:31.550
Maybe I shouldn't have split you guys up...

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:34.880
You're idols, so I warned them 
against shots to the face...

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:38.310
<b>Fuss Fuss Fuss</b>

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.910
you're not hurt, are you?

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:38.300
What...

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:41.180
What the hell is going on here?!

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:42.280
What do you mean?

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:44.770
Oh, you mean my big introduction?

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:48.430
That was all a performance 
to amp up the drama!

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:52.590
Should I have gone the "we'll rule 
this world together" route instead?

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:54.160
Not that part!

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:57.140
Why are you doing this?

00:14:57.890 --> 00:15:01.490
Kidnapping Mohiro-chan... 
filling the city with demons...

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:05.270
Have you been using us 
for that all this time?

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:07.720
Um, no?

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:10.540
I've been using all of that for <i>you</i>.

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:13.560
What?

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:17.750
I was hoping to keep this 
off-the-record, but...

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:18.760
Oh, well.

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:20.550
In other words...

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.560
<b>Several Years Ago</b>

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:26.570
<b>Other World Invasion Department</b>

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:26.570
<b>Boooored</b>

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:26.570
Director

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.560
Excuse me, MoKo-san!

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:28.880
You have to get a grip!

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:32.780
The Elf World guys are sending in 
another batch this afternoon!

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.680
Yeah, sorry.

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:36.580
What was today's assignment again?

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:37.830
Let's see...

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.330
<b>Forced labor</b>

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:41.750
Forcing the organisms we've 
kidnapped into doing awful stuff.

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.830
<b>Lab rats</b>

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:43.550
What, again?

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:45.340
<b>Exports to other worlds</b>

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:47.340
I don't think I'm cut out for this job...

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:47.340
<b>Oden eating contests</b>

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:48.460
<b>Sigh</b>

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:53.660
Well, my future's guaranteed 
no matter how I half-ass it...

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:58.340
Might as well head home early and 
grind through my anime backlog.

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:01.170
Emergency! Eto-san was defeated!

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:04.370
Eto-san? The Human World supervisor?

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:07.270
Isn't the Human World a wimpy D-class realm?

00:16:06.370 --> 00:16:07.390
How?

00:16:07.390 --> 00:16:11.560
I hear these things called magical 
girls kept foiling our plans...

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:15.320
You think we'll get an order to 
mount a full-scale invasion?

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:18.250
I-Is all of that true?

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:21.540
Why are you trembling like a newborn demon?

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:24.720
We'll get a replacement supervisor
 right away, don't worry.

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:26.450
N-No... wait!

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:28.200
I'll go!

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:37.220
<b>Strength Inside and Out</b>

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:30.520
I shall go.

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:33.020
You'll go personally, Director?

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:34.130
Why would you do that?!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:37.230
It's going to be a tough mission with 
a long period of investigation!

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:37.230
It's fine... it's fine!

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:40.990
I don't want to put you all in danger!

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.970
Director...

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.810
<b>Several Days Later</b>

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:47.110
Director!

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:50.820
<b>Director  Demon</b>

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:48.370
Be careful!

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:49.700
Good luck!

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:50.820
I do it all...

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:52.670
for demons!

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:55.320
<i>Of course, that was a lie.</i>

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:57.200
I get to meet magical girls...

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:59.750
Magical girls... Magical 
girls... Magical girls...

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:04.500
<i>That's right! As you know, 
I'm a massive magical girl geek.</i>

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:07.330
<i>And the real goal that motivated me was...</i>

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:09.250
I get to meet a magical girl!

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:12.950
Get to meet! Get to meet! 
Meetmeetmeetmeetmeet!

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:15.160
<i>And that was that!</i>

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:16.800
But...

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.790
<i>But what I found there was...</i>

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:26.160
I can't do it!

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:28.640
I mean it, Ko-san, I can't do this anymore!

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:30.600
Sayo-chin. Don't give up.

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:34.830
Look at me. I'm out of breath. 
My back is in agony...

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:42.170
<i>"Who is this old dude?"</i>

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:44.500
<i>My dream died.</i>

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:51.150
Hey. That's my mom you're 
calling an old dude...

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:55.630
Look, it's magical <i>girls</i> that I love,

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:58.060
not the middle-aged on the verge of death.

00:17:58.060 --> 00:18:01.600
I mean, even I have a hard upper limit...

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:12.480
Having lost all motivation, I became a NEET.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:17.490
<b>Hurrr...</b>

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:17.490
<b>Lovely Poem</b>

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:17.190
Invasions are dumb.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:21.120
<i>Suddenly it's like a social documentary...</i>

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:24.230
<i>I fell into total despair.</i>

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:26.250
But then, a problem arose...

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:30.750
Due to budget cuts, please pay any
 expenses <b>out of pocket</b> from now on.
❤Demon World❤

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:30.750
<b>Remaining funds</b>

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:28.400
<i>I ran out of funding.</i>

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:30.750
The demon world is an abusive company!

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.530
<i>I was forced to find a job.</i>

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:36.450
Why did I ever come here?

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:39.430
<b>Featured Job Listings</b>

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:38.180
This isn't what I signed up for...

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:39.430
<b>Lalayu Pro, Inc</b>

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:39.430
<b>Editor's Pick</b>

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:40.590
Lalayu Pro, Inc
Management Division
Idol Manager
<b>Yamo Konami</b>

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:42.300
<i>I stumbled into a job as a manager,</i>

00:18:42.750 --> 00:18:46.390
<i>but at some point, I became 
a real fan of yours!</i>

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:48.760
They're so cool!

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:54.410
<i>Then, one day...</i>

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:58.820
Dammit, what's wrong with 
that event planning company?

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:02.320
Maybe I'll make them all 
slaves in Moyosuch World!

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:06.580
Final Notice
There is an issue with your mission achievements and 
attitude. If you do not show immediate improvement,
 we will consider termination.
❤Demon World❤

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:11.080
Boy, the demon world is hard on failures.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:14.390
But we have one last audition, so 
I can't let myself be terminated.

00:19:14.390 --> 00:19:17.670
Maybe I'll just capture a nearby human...

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:22.440
What should I do?

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:26.110
<i>And just as I was thinking 
that over, it happened.</i>

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:29.260
Wanna be a magical girl?

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:31.470
<i>I was so excited!</i>

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:35.440
<i>I couldn't believe it had 
fallen into my lap like this!</i>

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:38.960
<i>I also realized I couldn't 
let this slip away!</i>

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:42.280
Hey, is Mohiro-kun at home today?

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:44.140
He should be coming home soon, I believe...

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:45.730
Oh, I see!

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:58.560
<i>Then, as you well know, you
 transformed to save Mohiro-kun.</i>

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:04.380
She still became a man, but 
it's better than being old!

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:06.840
<i>Again and again...</i>

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:10.160
Hello? Is this Obora Shimbun?

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:15.720
I just got a tip about magical girls 
fighting demons in Inagi's second district!

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:17.570
Magical girls(?) giving
 a nice thumbs up

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:17.570
<b>Magical Girls</b>

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:17.580
<i>Again...</i>

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:18.570
<b>Magical Girls Appear!</b>

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:19.690
Real magical girls!
I don't believe it
Really?!
I love magical girls!

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:22.100
<i>And again...</i>

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:26.250
And then, Magical Girls became famous.

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:28.480
It's been a lot of hard work.

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:33.240
I arranged it so the press would 
be present for the fights...

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:37.070
and of course, I sent in 
a few pictures myself.

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:39.160
That's right!

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:43.790
In other words, Mohiro-kun and the 
demons were all part of the marketing!

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:46.810
But you really...

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:49.930
You really did all this... 
for something so trivial?

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:52.280
Just to make us famous?

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:54.050
It's not trivial!

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:56.230
Magical girl idols!

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:59.910
You guys are my ultimate dream!

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:05.700
And today, I'm going to burn you 
Magical Girls into everyone's memory.

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:10.000
People get bored and forget 
things so quickly, you know...

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:13.680
That's why I have to do it now, when 
your popularity is at its peak!

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:19.010
Now, go on... defeat me.

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:26.850
In this moment, when people are 
most likely to pay attention,

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:32.970
we'll broadcast a scene of you defeating 
the demon boss and make you a hero.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:39.150
Magical Girl Ore will be an idol 
talked about for ages to come.

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:50.030
I love Sakuyo!

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:27.140 --> 00:23:30.250
<i>N-Next time, "Magical Girl - Watashi".</i>

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Magical Girl - Watashi</b>

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:34.040
<i>There's one page left in my history.</i>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Illustration: Monokubo
